{"v":4,"catch":"復活！NEO BOSCONIAN！","desc":"《BLAST OFF》是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於 1989 年發行的射擊遊戲。\n使用四種可選類型的裝備來擊敗復活的 NEO BOSCONIAN。\n此外，您可以按住射擊鍵來發射穿透子彈。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-09-26","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7d016f75b4d74fc3de6c06a4b607e32a6fac740b97744962e59e01fc9b1edf7c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9c5bbb9c9be4e12c89fde7c4a1c4b719bf66d1ab8cce1d5306cb859388f56926.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/78b05ca7c0c509c8c9f9ae462ac2883ea929fc2b8f88b347a64f2c5bf9525f2c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/92c140899786f8515f0cdc653eb35826efeb3987f25b0cdb7ab0b2b4804aa6c5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7247b5c72b1f46ae00c56d237ee774b0e022e35f2509fa3310bba39c6aebde79.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f8ab37a955958dccd9d55904231601f05322a79744c0eb546a21fa69386f73ac.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f6d01f6f2000","dlc":[]}